OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after body
OL,4,Afound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man whose body
OL,8,Fwas found in a property.
OL,10,FThe body of Christopher Streather, 51,
OL,11,Fwas discovered at an address on High
OL,12,FStreet in Burton Latimer,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, on Wednesday
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,16,FPolice believed the victim died several
OL,17,Fdays before he was found.
OL,19,FPhilip Moore, 43, of Nene Road, Burton
OL,20,FLatimer, has been charged with murder
OL,21,Fand is due to appear before magistrates
OL,22,Fin Northampton.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
